<title>UK: Inchcape up on positive broker comments.</title>
<headline>Inchcape up on positive broker comments.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in conglomerate Inchcape rose 11 pence to 260 pence on Tuesday as Merill Lynch repeated its buy recommendation, dealers said.</p>
<p>The broker reiterated its positive stance ahead of the publication tomorrow of a note, which will include positive comments on Inchcape, Merrill Lynch analyst Andrew Ripper said.</p>
<p>&quot;The shares are undervalued, forecasts are rising and returns are beginning to improve,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
